<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-18T21:38:29.089Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:38:29 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;ISWAP militants detonated landmines on a Borno highway, killing eight soldiers, and claimed a separate attack that killed 21 soldiers and militiamen at an army base. Bandits burned vehicles in Zamfara and assaulted police stations in Plateau, Abia and Borno, killing multiple officers. President Tinubu approved security equipment to protect trains from bandits, and the chief of army staff visited Borno after the president ordered clearance of terrorist camps. An air traffic controller was abducted at Sokoto airport and remains captive after 52 days. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNRHl0Sk5HN2w3OFBpaTBiX29hRXNXOHhLSHBIWkNmQnkwQmJtd0tiU3RfdW5SVVVENmJvLVlfVE42dEozR1daOWlXMzdGNEhVb1FiZ0U5OWpKRlNVeVloYjBKVE9SbThjUGtFTE55cTQ5dXU4ZFFHZ0c5b3duM2dZVF9kSGlFQi1mMXNGcXIxcmQtbFcydXdqSHRhSVZfSC1jWkRaakhWSEN2VzE3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOaHJrRGVlYURiNkdVbTc3bVJDVHJvcHhXYi1XX2hwRnUwZVJHRjlrc2oxY283Y1o0QWloakl3Ym80OWZiVnZldWhtNXdwWFBmZElTUHNJOUVRb3A2ckRKVkxKeHlPMnVhTFhwSjZmaXI1cngwY3NQWWV6OURWYlNnTkVJRVYzcS1RS0t6MVR2c1pwTERY?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOSkpNWHBhMHQtb0ZSb1Q2SmVYUVFpRDh1VTRfN3UxY1daQTNKblAwajZiamNlcUI5OVM3d0tjckY5LW8td0NwRmw3aFpYVEIyUVNyakxQTTAtczk5Q0FwTG1sVkVDaks1ZEZENWIwVGdpNTUzX2hhYWNQcHRKWXJZWHhoTDdlaFFSMG4tc0JXTzIweERteGR2Yg?oc=5&quot;&gt;TheCable&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOQlJMaDU4UGdrWEthQWRVbTIxRFppazhHUFROb3luOFF1NmszdHcweS16a2tsNkVZVlVDN3BvVW9tX3JqeF9WNWJPRFJJaWhhbDhrWGNTdjZzWTI3czB1Yk1lZkhiYjZJbWRvOG9FcE1Gd1VoZllFeE1qejR2RFhsZ2dOZ0w5TFJNWnRWR2pSWm1WQQ?oc=5&quo